subproblem.statement:
Let N ∈ ℕ, p ∈ ℝ≥0∞, c ∈ ℝ, K ∈ ℝ≥0, S ⊆ ℝ^N compact, u : ℝ^N → ℝ and v_j : ℝ^N → ℝ (j ∈ ℕ). Assume:
- each v_j is C¹ with tsupport v_j ⊆ S;
- ‖Dv_j(y)‖ ≤ K for all j and y;
- v_j(y) → u(y) for L^N-a.e. y;
- Dv_j(y) → Du(y) in ℝ^N →L[ℝ] ℝ for L^N-a.e. y;
- eLpNorm(v_j, p, L^N) ≤ ENNReal.ofReal(c ∫ ‖Dv_j‖ dL^N) for every j.
Then eLpNorm(u, p, L^N) ≤ ENNReal.ofReal(c ∫ ‖Du‖ dL^N). Here Dw(y) = fderiv ℝ w y and L^N = volume on ℝ^N = EuclideanSpace ℝ (Fin N).
